/T (We, the citizens of Caprica, stand at a crossroads. The institutions that were meant to serve us have grown corrupt, indifferent, and captured by narrow interests. The constitution we inherited is riddled with loopholes exploited by those who mistake power for mandate. The promises of previous governments ring hollow in the streets of our cities and the villages of our regions.)
