149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Progressive Caprica is a party of individual liberty and social solidarity - understanding these not as opposites but as complements. A citizen who is hungry is not free. A citizen who is silenced is not equal. A citizen who is left behind is not a partner in the republic but a casualty of it.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
