151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Free expression is the oxygen of a republic. Progressive Caprica guarantees the right of every Caprican to speak, to publish, to assemble, and to organise without fear of state suppression. We believe in the open marketplace of ideas and the power of democratic debate to distinguish truth from falsehood.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (However, liberty is not a shield for those who would destroy the republic that grants it. Speech that organises, incites, or advocates for extremist movements that seek to undermine the constitutional order and democratic foundations of Caprica is not protected expression. It is a threat - and it will be treated as one.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
