154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Every Caprican citizen, regardless of sex, sexuality, gender identity, ethnicity, religion, or region, stands equal before the law and equal in the dignity afforded to them by the republic. Progressive Caprica will legislate to close every gap in equality protections and enforce those protections without compromise. We stand with the LGBTQ+ community of Caprica without reservation, without qualification, and without apology. Every legal right, every protection, and every recognition that the law can afford - it shall. On this there is no negotiation.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
