156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Women in Caprica have borne too long the weight of structural inequality. Progressive Caprica commits to equal pay enforcement, equal representation in public institutions, and targeted support measures that acknowledge the specific barriers women face in civic, professional, and social life. We believe in meritocracy - and meritocracy cannot function where the field is not level.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
