160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (Progressive Caprica supports the controlled legalisation and regulation of cannabis and other low-risk substances. Prohibition has failed. It has enriched criminal networks, clogged our courts, and criminalised thousands of Capricans for choices that harmed no one but potentially themselves. Regulated legalisation, with appropriate age restrictions and public health oversight, is the rational policy.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
