/P 90 0 R
/E (Caprica is a nation that benefits from the contribution of those who choose it. Progressive Caprica supports a controlled immigration system built on contribution - academic talent, skilled labour, economic investment. We welcome those who come to build with us. We maintain the right of the republic to manage its borders with firmness and its intake with purpose.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
